00:39:10,150 --> 00:39:11,810
My mother would never do something like that.

844
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:13,510
I beg you, tell me

845
00:39:14,280 --> 00:39:16,480
what really happened that year

846
00:39:16,550 --> 00:39:19,410
and why my mother had to leave the Xie mansion.

847
00:39:19,670 --> 00:39:20,760
I only know that

848
00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:25,550
That year, Mrs. Jin...

849
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,360
Mrs. Xia, what are you doing here?

850
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,630
Does a vulgar actress like you think

851
00:39:44,030 --> 00:39:46,090
Do they deserve to live in the Danyue Pavilion?

852
