It was Mrs. Xie who arranged for me to live here.

853
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:53,590
Be quiet!

854
00:40:02,320 --> 00:40:04,520
Concubine Xia died that same night.

855
00:40:05,550 --> 00:40:07,190
That made everyone believe

856
